  "articleBody": "Start by defining the office’s use, then have the existing garage evaluated for structure, moisture, insulation, lighting, electrical service, ventilation, parking, and permit requirements. A successful conversion includes a documented design, clear scope, appropriate approvals, coordinated construction, and final inspection rather than finishes alone.",
